  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0200-0101/未定年-文景宫廷与外家.md",
    "note_anchor": "sj049-dou-huanglao-note",
    "placement_anchor": "sj049-cite-041",
    "number": 4,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷049-外戚世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p016",
    "quote": "竇太后好黃帝、老子言，帝及太子諸竇不得不讀黃帝、老子，尊其術。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0200-0101/bce-0135.md",
    "note_anchor": "note-1",
    "placement_anchor": "sj049-cite-042",
    "number": 1,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷049-外戚世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p017",
    "quote": "竇太后後孝景帝六歲（建元六年）崩，合葬霸陵。遺詔盡以東宮金錢財物賜長公主嫖。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0200-0101/bce-0156.md",
    "note_anchor": "sj049-liuche-birth-note",
    "placement_anchor": "sj049-cite-043",
    "number": 14,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷049-外戚世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p018",
    "quote": "王太后，槐裏人，母曰臧兒。臧兒者，故燕王臧荼孫也。臧兒嫁為槐裏王仲妻，生男曰信，與兩女。而仲死，臧兒更嫁長陵田氏，生男蚡、勝。臧兒長女嫁為金王孫婦，生一女矣，而臧兒卜筮之，曰兩女皆當貴。因欲奇兩女，乃奪金氏。金氏怒，不肯予決，乃內之太子宮。太子幸愛之，生三女一男。男方在身時，王美人夢日入其懷。以告太子，太子曰：「此貴徵也。」未生而孝文帝崩，孝景帝即位，王夫人生男。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0200-0101/未定年-文景宫廷与外家.md",
    "note_anchor": "sj049-wang-children-note",
    "placement_anchor": "sj049-cite-044",
    "number": 5,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷049-外戚世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p019",
    "quote": "先是臧兒又入其少女兒姁，兒姁生四男。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0200-0101/未定年-文景宫廷与外家.md",
    "note_anchor": "sj049-wang-children-note",
    "placement_anchor": "sj049-cite-045",
    "number": 5,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷049-外戚世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p025",
    "quote": "景帝十三男，一男為帝，十二男皆為王。而兒姁早卒，其四子皆為王。王太后長女號日平陽公主，次為南宮公主，次為林慮公主。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0200-0101/bce-0157.md",
    "note_anchor": "note-6",
    "placement_anchor": "sj049-cite-046",
    "number": 6,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷049-外戚世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p020",
    "quote": "景帝為太子時，薄太后以薄氏女為妃。及景帝立，立妃曰薄皇后。皇后毋子，毋寵。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0200-0101/bce-0151.md",
    "note_anchor": "note-2",
    "placement_anchor": "sj049-cite-047",
    "number": 2,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷049-外戚世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p020",
    "quote": "薄太后崩，廢薄皇后。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0200-0101/bce-0153.md",
    "note_anchor": "note-2",
    "placement_anchor": "sj049-cite-048",
    "number": 2,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷049-外戚世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p021",
    "quote": "景帝長男榮，其母栗姬。栗姬，齊人也。立榮為太子。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0200-0101/bce-0151.md",
    "note_anchor": "note-3",
    "placement_anchor": "sj049-cite-049",
    "number": 3,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷049-外戚世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p021",
    "quote": "長公主嫖有女，欲予為妃。栗姬妒，而景帝諸美人皆因長公主見景帝，得貴幸，皆過栗姬，栗姬日怨怒，謝長公主，不許。長公主欲予王夫人，王夫人許之。長公主怒，而日讒栗姬短於景帝曰：「栗姬與諸貴夫人幸姬會，常使侍者祝唾其背，挾邪媚道。」景帝以故望之。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0200-0101/bce-0151.md",
    "note_anchor": "note-4",
    "placement_anchor": "sj049-cite-050",
    "number": 4,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷049-外戚世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p022",
    "quote": "景帝嘗體不安，心不樂，屬諸子為王者於栗姬，曰：「百歲後，善視之。」栗姬怒，不肯應，言不遜。景帝恚，心嗛之而未發也。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0200-0101/bce-0151.md",
    "note_anchor": "note-4",
    "placement_anchor": "sj049-cite-051",
    "number": 4,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷049-外戚世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p023",
    "quote": "長公主日譽王夫人男之美，景帝亦賢之，又有曩者所夢日符，計未有所定。王夫人知帝望栗姬，因怒未解，陰使人趣大臣立栗姬為皇后。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0200-0101/bce-0150.md",
    "note_anchor": "note-1",
    "placement_anchor": "sj049-cite-052",
    "number": 1,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷049-外戚世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p023",
    "quote": "大行奏事畢，曰：「『子以母貴，母以子貴』，今太子母無號，宜立為皇后。」景帝怒曰：「是而所宜言邪！」遂案誅大行，而廢太子為臨江王。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0200-0101/bce-0150.md",
    "note_anchor": "note-1",
    "placement_anchor": "sj049-cite-053",
    "number": 1,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷049-外戚世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p023",
    "quote": "栗姬愈恚恨，不得見，以憂死。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0200-0101/bce-0150.md",
    "note_anchor": "note-4",
    "placement_anchor": "sj049-cite-054",
    "number": 4,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷049-外戚世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p023",
    "quote": "卒立王夫人為皇后，其男為太子，",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0200-0101/bce-0145.md",
    "note_anchor": "note-3",
    "placement_anchor": "sj049-cite-055",
    "number": 3,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷049-外戚世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p023",
    "quote": "封皇后兄信為蓋侯。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
