    "note_anchor": "note-3",
    "placement_anchor": "sj049-cite-056",
    "number": 3,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷049-外戚世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p024",
    "quote": "景帝崩，太子襲號為皇帝。",
