    "number": 3,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷049-外戚世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p028",
    "quote": "聞衛子夫大幸，恚，幾死者數矣。上愈怒。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0200-0101/bce-0130.md",
    "note_anchor": "sj049-chen-deposed-note",
