    "note_anchor": "note-15",
    "placement_anchor": "sj049-cite-072",
    "number": 14,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷049-外戚世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p030",
    "quote": "衛子夫已立為皇后，先是衛長君死，",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
